Association StudentCohortAssociation
    documentation 'This association represents the Cohort(s) for which a student is designated.
    domain entity Student
        documentation 'The Student associated with the Cohort.
    domain entity Cohort
        documentation 'Reference to the Cohort associated with the Student.
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year on which the Student was first identified as part of 
		'the Cohort.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year on which the Student was removed as part of the 
		'Cohort.
        is optional
    reference Section
		documentation 'The Cohort representing the subdivision of students within one or more sections. 
		'For example, a group of students may be given additional instruction and tracked 
		'as a cohort.
        is optional collection

